cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository or the accompanying papers, please cite both
  the research paper and this artifact.
type: software
title: >-
  Golden Signals for AI Workloads on Shared GPU Clusters
  (research artifact repository)
abstract: >-
  Research artifact for five *candidate* golden signals for AI workloads
  on shared GPU clusters (Queue-of-Work Reliability, GPU-Compute
  Effectiveness, HBM-Pressure Headroom, Straggler Amplification Index,
  Output-Quality Calibration) and their SLO templates. Only Queue-of-Work
  Reliability is measured in the companion traces; the others are defined
  here as a monitoring basis, not a four-environment empirical validation.
